<div class="ctr">
<p style="font-size:11pt; letter-spacing:.09em; margin:0 0 14px"><b>UNIFORM EDITION &mdash; FOR ADOPTION BY ANY JURISDICTION</b></p>
<p class="std">GRUS-STD-60084</p>
<p style="font-family:'Courier New',monospace; font-size:10pt; letter-spacing:.05em; margin:0 0 8px">v2.0-U &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; UNIFORM EDITION</p>
<h1 id="measurement-and-reporting-of-resource-consumptionby-large-computational-">Measurement and Reporting of Resource Consumption<br>by Large Computational Loads<a class="pl" href="#measurement-and-reporting-of-resource-consumptionby-large-computational-" aria-label="Link to this section">&#182;</a></h1>
<p class="sub">Proposed new <span class="je"><span class="jn">J-3</span><span class="jt">rule designation</span>&nbsp;<span class="jr"></span></span> &mdash; Measurement and Reporting of Resource<br>Consumption by Large Computational Loads</p>
<p class="meta">
Submitted for adoption to <span class="je"><span class="jn">J-1</span><span class="jt">adopting authority</span>&nbsp;<span class="jrl"></span></span><br>
pursuant to <span class="je"><span class="jn">J-4</span><span class="jt">procedural route</span>&nbsp;<span class="jrl"></span></span><br><br>
<b>Green Recursive Utility Service LLC</b> &middot; Nicholas Wray Cordova, Principal<br>
205 East 3rd Street, Weatherford, Texas 76086<br>
Texas SOS 806584578 &middot; SAM UEI JGT4J9QKGCQ3<br>
management@greenrecursiveutilityservice.org &middot; 817-404-6379<br><br>
Uniform Edition issued 7 October 2026 &middot; CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication<br>
The same standard as GRUS-STD-60084 v2.0, doi:10.5281/zenodo.23072905, of record in Project No. 60084
</p>
