<tr><td class="m c">J-10</td><td>Existing usage-reporting requirement</td><td>Any survey, inventory, registration, or reporting requirement already applicable to computational facilities in the jurisdiction, with its compliance record if known.</td><td>None</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="m c">J-11</td><td>Audit or verification directive</td><td>Any executive order, legislative directive, or agency order requiring verification or audit of computational-facility resource consumption, with its date.</td><td>None</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr>
