<tr><td class="m c">J-36</td><td>Construction of &ldquo;shall&rdquo;</td><td>The provision of the jurisdiction's statutory construction law governing the mandatory sense of &ldquo;shall.&rdquo;</td><td>Mandatory</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="m c">J-37</td><td>Public comment</td><td>The provision governing the public comment period on a proposed rule.</td><td>No default</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr>
